#!/usr/bin/env python
"""SCons entry point for the macos_desktop GDExtension.

Usage (from anywhere):
    .local/tools/venv/bin/scons -C native/macos_desktop \
        platform=macos arch=universal target=template_debug

Or use native/macos_desktop/build.sh, which also installs the test artifacts.
The godot-cpp checkout defaults to <repo>/.local/godot-cpp and can be
overridden with the GODOT_CPP_PATH environment variable.
"""

SConscript("SConscript")
